      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{62b61f8ec938a62475e4cd14|full_name}\n\nSeems silly. Since I can be banned from entering certain instances depending on groups. So the list is just a much worse version of the Social tab's \"Friend Locations\" list.\n\nWould be nice if I could at least collapse this useless list and save the screen space entirely on the Live Now tab.",
