  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "The new \"Live Now\" tab's \"Friend Locations\" doesn't show who the owner of the instance is. But on the list below, \"Group Activity\", it does show the owning group.\n\nIt would be nice if the instances listed in the Friend Locations also had the owner shown, be it a group, person, or a normal public instance. It also doesn't show the instance types or anything else, making this list somewhat useless.",
